{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Swami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a set of patch helpers — one per Origami patch, named after the patch, so an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" becomes a ","type":"text"},{"code":".drag(…)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifier and an Interaction becomes ","type":"text"},{"code":".interaction(…)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"— plus a gallery of Origami prototypes translated to SwiftUI. The patches are the reusable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"part; each entry in the gallery shows those patches composed into a working view. Where","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI already has the right tool the translation uses it directly; where it doesn’t, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch helper fills the gap.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Gallery","level":2,"anchor":"Gallery"},{"type":"links","style":"detailedGrid","items":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Pinch"]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Origami patterns, rebuilt as SwiftUI you can read — each one a worked example of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patches behind it, so you can see how a prototype’s behavior is written and reach for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same patch on your own layers."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Patterns","anchor":"Patterns","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag